{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-09_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-08","title":"瘋人的辯護","storyCode":"16-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"421992e60c11528ef8b10ec11fb84cf3b838ee0e17479ebf84c65329f9484f9c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在礦工領袖雷爾金的惡夢之中，他們從未真正殺死那個內衛。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要……不……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你看到年輕的女人倒在你的眼前，黑色的長矛從她的屍體上慢慢“生長”出來。\n在她很快就不再動彈的身體旁邊，另一個人彈動著雙腳，試圖將自己推離這片危險的區域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐懼的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪、怪物……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_29"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色不斷逼近著。黑色、黑色、黑色。一切都是黑色，只有血是鮮紅的。你甚至無法確認自己面對的是否為活物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要怕——不要退後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有力氣的，都站起來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色繼續從屍山血海中蹚過。地上有礦工、衛兵，也有普通的烏薩斯人。\n不間斷的尖叫聲使你清楚，無論自己是否轉身逃跑，那些幾乎憑空出現的長矛都會追上你。\n於是你只能眼看著穿透了無數軀體的長矛不斷從大地之中拔起，幾乎要將整個地面覆蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，一根根長矛從屍山上抽離，在黑影的手中重組成了一柄長劍。\n而後那辨不清話音的存在將手中長劍高高舉起，指向你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要站著死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……我不會死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不會死在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯的期許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，不切實際。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，我們來幫你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們——列尼亞，怎麼是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來幫你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們來了，你們來幫我了！我的戰友，你們也在這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們並肩作戰，就像以前那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像以前那樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來！幫我圍住他，就像以前那樣！一個人倒下了，另一個人就填補他的位置；一群人倒下了，另一群人就填補他們的位置！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跟在我身後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":"avg_npc_077","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢……"},{"type":"narration","text":"你能感到身後的熱源，灼燒感彷彿滾燙的爐火在身上蔓延。那些使你血液沸騰的，也使你雙眼清明，他們高喊你的名字，將你向前推去。\n在這堅實的簇擁之下，你一躍而起，對準那黑色身軀上狀似胸腔的位置——\n捅下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵……"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有血滴落的聲音。沒有抽搐的反應。\n只是刀刃的阻力在一點點變小，直到完全消失。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來……原來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“皇帝的利刃”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……“迦弗里伊爾”——"},{"type":"narration","text":"最後一個音節說出口，原本被黑影撐起的制服像突然脫力一般，再無反抗的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"你終結了這個怪物。以勇氣，以果決，以膽魄。\n以不存在的“友人”的支持。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_5_7_shining"},{"type":"narration","text":"“——倒下了，他倒下了！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“雷爾金，你——我們，我們殺死了——”\n“我們殺死了他！！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“雷爾金，雷爾金？我們接下來該怎麼辦？”\n“雷爾金——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_newiceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！雷爾金！"},{"type":"narration","text":"人群如潮水一般湧向你。他們將你托起，又將你拉下。這種失重的感覺，你從前也曾有過。\n人群歡呼，人群吵嚷。震耳欲聾的迴響中，絕不應該出現在這裡的人喊出你的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"軍人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——雷爾金——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"你閉上眼睛，隨他的話語回到那片森林中。一支邊防駐軍，一次有去無回的任務。\n現在，你不在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"贏了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們贏了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g16_smokeonblackgroud"},{"type":"narration","text":"升起又墜落的瞬間，你看向遠處那團仍未散盡的黑塵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“黑色的雪”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑色的塵煙如同無數條細小蜿蜒的根鬚，從那制服的每一個孔隙中鑽出，貪婪地纏繞著、覆蓋著、吸附著，直到將其完全包覆。\n在黑煙的包裹下，那制服漸漸又顯現出人形，彷彿——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_30"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿“他”從未死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
